<ol class="refs">
  <li id="thy-r1"><span class="rf-for">硬い弦の周波数</span><span class="rf-src">N. H. Fletcher, “Normal vibration frequencies of a stiff piano string,” <i>J. Acoust. Soc. Am.</i>, vol. 36, no. 1, pp. 203–209, 1964</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r2"><span class="rf-for">撥弦の合成、損失の式と係数、統計的なギター、ナイロン弦の線密度と張力（[3] と合わせて）</span><span class="rf-src">J. Woodhouse, “On the synthesis of guitar plucks,” <i>Acta Acustica united with Acustica</i>, vol. 90, pp. 928–944, 2004</span></li>
